<BaseLayout title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogType="website" lang="zh-CN" author=" "  datePublished="2024-09-01" dateModified="2024-09-01">
  <article class="page-content">
    <h1 class="page-title">{page.h1}</h1>
    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:1200px"><div class="wp-block-cover aligncenter"><img src="/images/Food-Factory1-1024x456.jpg" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="1024" height="456" class="wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-299 size-large" alt="food materials processing line" style="object-position:55% 85%" title="中国马铃薯产品供应商" /><span aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-20 has-background-dim"></span><div class="wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow"><h1 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size"><strong>优质马铃薯原料的全球制造商</strong></h1><p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"><em>专业生产马铃薯片, 淀粉类, 面粉, 和冷冻薯条</em></p></div></div></div></div><div style="height:66px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:100%"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><mark style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: #098b4d;" class="has-inline-color"><strong>高品质马铃薯片, 炸薯条, 淀粉制造商和供应商</strong></mark></h2></div></div><div style="height:66px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img src="/images/Dinweys-potato-field.jpg" decoding="async" width="893" height="192" alt="potato materials field" class="wp-image-319" style="aspect-ratio:4.651110486364915;width:1120px;height:auto" title="中国马铃薯产品供应商2" /></figure></div></div></div><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-x-large-font-size" id="h-our-advantages">我们的优势</h2><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><figure class="wp-block-table"><table class="has-fixed-layout"><tbody><tr><td><strong>地点 &amp; 原料</strong></td><td>位于河北, 中国: 位于 <strong>41° 北纬 马铃薯种植区</strong>, 提供了适合优质马铃薯种植的气候和广阔的地理区域. 邻近主要优质马铃薯种植基地和主要出口港口.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>技术优势</strong></td><td>马铃薯深加工专业知识: 由中国食品行业顶尖专家领衔，专注于马铃薯原料功能开发和工艺工程. 我们利用 <strong>最先进的生产线</strong> 保证产品加工质量和一致性.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>质量 &amp; 遵守</strong></td><td><strong>综合认证:</strong> 我们拥有完整的产品资质和安全体系, 包括 <strong>ISO, 危害分析及关键控制点, 商业研究中心, 清真</strong>, ETC。, 确保全球监管合规性. 我们维持 <strong>优秀的生产工人和食品工程师</strong>, 支持者 <strong>完善的检测设备和实验室</strong> 保证产品质量稳定、优越.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>供应链 &amp; 容量</strong></td><td><strong>产能充足:</strong> 我们充足稳定的产能可以满足国际大买家和采购订单的多样化需求.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>服务 &amp; 合伙</strong></td><td>熟练的英语沟通 &amp; 灵活的OEM: 为全球客户提供全面支持, 包括土豆片和薯条的自有品牌定制.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>客户认可</strong></td><td>客户包括全球知名品牌 (百事可乐中国, 猎户座, 大理, 统一泰国). 质量稳定、供货及时得到证实.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div></div><div style="height:56px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size wp-elements-1" id="h-food-materials-product-range" style="color:#26a906;text-transform:uppercase">我们的核心马铃薯产品组合</h2></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>土豆片</strong></h3><figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded"><img src="/images/Dinweys-Potato-flakes-1024x1024.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="1024" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-1329" title="中国马铃薯产品供应商铃薯淀粉" /></figure><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">从标准品种到高档品种, 我们的马铃薯片旨在满足不同行业的需求.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">支持者 <strong>FSSC认证</strong>, 我们拥有良好的全球出口记录.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">我们专注于 <strong>OEM解决方案</strong>, 允许我们根据您的具体要求定制规格.</p></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>冷冻薯条</strong></h3><figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-style-rounded"><img src="/images/Dinweys-french-fries.jpg" decoding="async" width="632" height="632" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-1331" title="中国马铃薯产品供应商铃薯淀粉" /></figure><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">我们经过 ISO 认证的工厂生产高品质冷冻薯条 <strong>各种剪裁和尺寸</strong>.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">我们以灵活性为荣, 奉献 <strong>定制 OEM 服务</strong> 完美符合您的品牌和客户偏好.</p></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h3 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center"><strong>马铃薯淀粉</strong></h3><figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-style-rounded"><img src="/images/potato-starch-1024x1024.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="1024" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-1246" title="中国马铃薯产品供应商铃薯淀粉" /></figure><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">专为多功能性而设计, 我们的马铃薯淀粉是 <strong>A级产品</strong> 严格按照中国国家标准生产.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:14px">其卓越的品质使其成为多个领域应用的理想选择, 确保一致性和性能.</p></div></div><div style="height:56px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img src="/images/Dinweys-potato-field1-1024x168.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="168" alt="Food materials | raw potatoes" class="wp-image-315" style="width:1200px" title="中国马铃薯产品供应商" /></figure></div></div></div><p class="has-text-align-center has-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph"> 请随时联系我们</p><p class="has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:none"><strong>地址:</strong>&nbsp;#3, 建设北硅谷, Qiaodong District, Zhangjiakou City, 中国.</p><p class="has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:none"><strong>电话 | WhatsApp | 微信:</strong>&nbsp;+86 13323237275</p><p class="has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph" style="text-transform:none"><strong>电子邮件:&nbsp;</strong><a href="mailto:martin@dinweys.com">martin@dinweys.com</a></p><p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"><strong>中文站</strong>: <a href="https://www.dinweys.cn/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">丁威网</a></p><p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>`} />
  </article>
